{"kind":"html","caption":"把到达第 i 阶的最后一步分成两类：从第 i-1 阶走 1 步，或从第 i-2 阶走 2 步，因此 dp[i] = dp[i-1] + dp[i-2]。动画使用示例 n = 3，依次计算 dp[1]、dp[2]、dp[3]，最终得到 3 种方法。只需保留前两项即可把空间复杂度降为 O(1)，时间复杂度为 O(n)。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>爬楼梯可视化</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 15px; }\n  body{ padding: 28px clamp(16px, 4vw, 52px) 44px; }\n  main{ width: 100%; max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 10px; color: #fff; font-size:14px; }\n  .lead { margin: 0; color: #b8b8b8; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .panel { margin-top: 22px; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #454545; border-radius: 12px; background: #252526; }\n  .panel-title { margin-bottom: 16px; color: #fff; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 650; }\n  .steps { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: clamp(8px, 2vw, 18px); min-height: 220px; padding: 14px 8px 4px; }\n  .step { flex: 1 1 0; min-width: 68px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 8px; }\n  .step-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; min-height: 64px; padding: 10px 6px; border: 2px solid #565656; border-radius: 8px 8px 2px 2px; background: #333; transition: background .35s, border-color .35s, color .35s; }\n  .step:nth-child(1) .step-card { height: 68px; }\n  .step:nth-child(2) .step-card { height: 100px; }\n  .step:nth-child(3) .step-card { height: 132px; }\n  .step:nth-child(4) .step-card { height: 164px; }\n  .step-card.active { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; color: #fff; }\n  .num, .formula, .route-code, .counter { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .num { font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; }\n  .index { margin-top: 4px; color: #c5c5c5; font-size: 13px; }\n  .step-label { min-height: 38px; text-align: center; color: #9d9d9d; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; }\n  .step-label.active { color: #75baff; font-weight: 650; }\n  .explain { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(220px, .8fr); gap: 18px; margin-top: 20px; }\n  .formula-box, .result-box { min-height: 118px; padding: 18px; border: 1px solid #454545; border-radius: 10px; background: #2d2d30; }\n  .formula { margin-top: 12px; color: #75baff; font-size: clamp(15px, 2.2vw, 20px); line-height: 1.6; }\n  .muted { color: #a7a7a7; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .counter { margin-top: 12px; color: #3794ff; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 750; }\n  .routes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-top: 16px; }\n  .route { padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #484848; border-radius: 8px; background: #2d2d30; opacity: .38; transition: opacity .35s, background .35s, border-color .35s; }\n  .route.on { opacity: 1; background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .route-name { margin-bottom: 7px; font-size: 13px; color: #cfcfcf; }\n  .route-code { color: #fff; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n  .progress { height: 5px; margin-top: 20px; border-radius: 99px; background: #414141; }\n  .progress-fill { width: 0; height: 100%; border-radius: 99px; background: #3794ff; }\n  @media (max-width: 680px) {\n    body{ padding-top: 20px; }\n    .panel { padding: 15px; }\n    .steps { gap: 7px; padding-left: 0; padding-right: 0; }\n    .step { min-width: 54px; }\n    .explain { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .routes { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  }\n  /* COMPACT */ html,body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}body{padding:8px 10px 10px!important}main{max-width:560px!important}h1{font-size:14px!important;margin:0 0 4px!important;color:#d4d4d4!important}.lead{font-size:12px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important;margin:0 0 6px!important}.panel{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important;margin-top:8px!important;border:1px solid #3c3c3c!important}.panel-title{font-size:13px!important;margin-bottom:6px!important}.steps{min-height:100px!important;gap:6px!important;padding:4px 0!important}.step{min-width:48px!important}.step-card{min-height:36px!important;padding:4px 2px!important;border-width:1px!important;border-radius:4px!important}.num{font-size:13px!important}.step-label{font-size:10px!important;min-height:auto!important}.explain{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:8px!important;margin-top:8px!important}.formula-box,.result-box{padding:8px 10px!important;min-height:auto!important;border-radius:6px!important}.formula{font-size:13px!important;margin-top:6px!important}.counter{font-size:13px!important;margin-top:4px!important}.routes{gap:6px!important;margin-top:8px!important}.route{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important}.route-code{font-size:12px!important}.progress{height:3px!important;margin-top:8px!important}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>示例 n = 3：从最后一步倒推</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">到达某一阶，只可能从前一阶跨 1 步，或从前两阶跨 2 步。</p>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">动态规划状态</div>\n    <div class=\"steps\">\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"step-card\" data-step=\"0\"><div class=\"num\" data-value=\"1\">1</div><div class=\"index\">dp[0]</div></div>\n        <div class=\"step-label\" data-label=\"0\">起点：一种空走法</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"step-card\" data-step=\"1\"><div class=\"num\" data-value=\"1\">1</div><div class=\"index\">dp[1]</div></div>\n        <div class=\"step-label\" data-label=\"1\">只能走 1 阶</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"step-card\" data-step=\"2\"><div class=\"num\" data-value=\"2\">?</div><div class=\"index\">dp[2]</div></div>\n        <div class=\"step-label\" data-label=\"2\">等待计算</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"step-card\" data-step=\"3\"><div class=\"num\" data-value=\"3\">?</div><div class=\"index\">dp[3]</div></div>\n        <div class=\"step-label\" data-label=\"3\">等待计算</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"explain\">\n      <div class=\"formula-box\">\n        <div class=\"muted\" id=\"message\">先确定边界：站在起点记作一种方案。</div>\n        <div class=\"formula\" id=\"formula\">dp[0] = 1，dp[1] = 1</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"result-box\">\n        <div class=\"muted\">当前得到的方法数</div>\n        <div class=\"counter\" id=\"counter\">1</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"panel-title\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">最终 3 种走法</div>\n    <div class=\"routes\">\n      <div class=\"route\" data-route=\"0\"><div class=\"route-name\">方法 1</div><div class=\"route-code\">1 + 1 + 1</div></div>\n      <div class=\"route\" data-route=\"1\"><div class=\"route-name\">方法 2</div><div class=\"route-code\">1 + 2</div></div>\n      <div class=\"route\" data-route=\"2\"><div class=\"route-name\">方法 3</div><div class=\"route-code\">2 + 1</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"progress-fill\" id=\"progress\"></div></div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const frames = [\n    { active: [0,1], shown: 1, message: '先确定边界：站在起点记作一种方案。', formula: 'dp[0] = 1，dp[1] = 1', labels: ['起点：一种空走法','只能走 1 阶','等待计算','等待计算'], routes: 0 },\n    { active: [0,1,2], shown: 2, message: '到第 2 阶：最后走 1 阶或 2 阶。', formula: 'dp[2] = dp[1] + dp[0] = 1 + 1 = 2', labels: ['提供 dp[0]','提供 dp[1]','得到 2 种','等待计算'], routes: 0 },\n    { active: [1,2,3], shown: 3, message: '到第 3 阶：汇总来自第 2 阶和第 1 阶的方案。', formula: 'dp[3] = dp[2] + dp[1] = 2 + 1 = 3', labels: ['已完成','提供 dp[1]','提供 dp[2]','得到 3 种'], routes: 0 },\n    { active: [3], shown: 3, message: '计算完成：示例 n = 3 的答案是 3。', formula: '答案 = dp[3] = 3', labels: ['边界','已计算','已计算','最终答案'], routes: 3 }\n  ];\n  const cards = [...document.querySelectorAll('[data-step]')];\n  const labels = [...document.querySelectorAll('[data-label]')];\n  const nums = [...document.querySelectorAll('.num')];\n  const routes = [...document.querySelectorAll('[data-route]')];\n  const message = document.getElementById('message');\n  const formula = document.getElementById('formula');\n  const counter = document.getElementById('counter');\n  const progress = document.getElementById('progress');\n  let frame = 0;\n  const duration = 2200;\n\n  function render() {\n    const f = frames[frame];\n    cards.forEach((card, i) => card.classList.toggle('active', f.active.includes(i)));\n    labels.forEach((label, i) => {\n      label.textContent = f.labels[i];\n      label.classList.toggle('active', f.active.includes(i));\n    });\n    nums[0].textContent = '1';\n    nums[1].textContent = '1';\n    nums[2].textContent = frame >= 1 ? '2' : '?';\n    nums[3].textContent = frame >= 2 ? '3' : '?';\n    message.textContent = f.message;\n    formula.textContent = f.formula;\n    counter.textContent = String(f.shown);\n    routes.forEach((route, i) => route.classList.toggle('on', i < f.routes));\n    progress.style.transition = 'none';\n    progress.style.width = '0%';\n    requestAnimationFrame(() => requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n      progress.style.transition = `width ${duration}ms linear`;\n      progress.style.width = '100%';\n    }));\n  }\n\n  render();\n  setInterval(() => {\n    frame = (frame + 1) % frames.length;\n    render();\n  }, duration);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":"","time_complexity":"O(n)","space_complexity":"O(n), 滚动 O(1)","complexity_note":"n 为台阶数. 每个状态由前两项相加得到. 保存完整 dp 表需要 O(n), 仅保留前两项即可用 O(1) 额外空间求出方法数."}
